      "title": "SLO targets (catalog)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Journey | Availability | Latency |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Browse** | 99.9% / 30d | p95 &lt; 500ms (goal 0.95 \u2264 500ms) |\n| **Checkout** | 99.95% / 30d | p95 &lt; 1s (goal 0.95 \u2264 1000ms) |\n\n**Cloud Console:** Monitoring \u2192 Services \u2192 `boutique-frontend` / `boutique-checkout`.\nBurn policies: `browse-*-burn`, `checkout-*-burn` \u2192 PagerDuty (topic 14).\nApply latency SLOs: [topic 17](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/setup/17-latency-slos-dashboards.md)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Alert \u2192 runbook",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Policy | Runbook |\n| --- | --- |\n| browse-availability-burn | [runbook](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/runbooks/browse-availability-burn.md) |\n| browse-latency-burn | [runbook](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/runbooks/browse-latency-burn.md) |\n| checkout-availability-burn | [runbook](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/runbooks/checkout-availability-burn.md) |\n| checkout-latency-burn | [runbook](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/runbooks/checkout-latency-burn.md) |\n| uptime-check-failed | [runbook](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/runbooks/uptime-check-failed.md) |\n| redis-cart-down | [runbook](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/runbooks/redis-cart-down.md) |\n\nRegistry: `observability/monitoring/runbooks.yaml`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "On-call quick path",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. Ack PagerDuty \u2014 open runbook from alert body  \n2. Cloud Monitoring \u2192 SLO burn chart (which window fired?)  \n3. Golden signals dashboard for pod CPU/memory/restarts  \n4. Cloud Trace for checkout PlaceOrder  \n5. Error budget: [policy](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/error-budget-policy.md)  \n6. Card: [quick-reference](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/operations/quick-reference.md)\n\n**Note:** Grafana does not replace Cloud Monitoring SLO burn charts; use both."
      }
    },
    {
